From 8f67825c3601e99bbe4a673732656cb206a14111 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TeamHarrisCali <34009957+TeamHarrisCali@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 14:33:34 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Mic: both 16 bit samples of every FIFO word (32728 samples/s,
 the upper half was thrown away: an unfiltered decimation that folded high
 frequencies into the voice band), sample order detected from the data,
 capture rate 32728; dsmemo filters (80 Hz high-pass, 49 tap 4 kHz low-pass)
 and halves to 16364 Hz; Photos is now a mode of dscam (one 3D user, starts
 via 'dscam photos', one running copy told by signals), camera off while
 viewing

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
